{
  "title": "High-Protein Chicken Burrito Bowl with Greek Yogurt Crema",
  "description": "These high-protein chicken burrito bowls combine seasoned lean chicken breast, black beans, and fluffy rice in 25 minutes. Each serving delivers 42g of protein to fuel your day. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican-American",
